<title>USA: Armco raising some steel prices.</title>
<headline>Armco raising some steel prices.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armco Inc said Friday it would increase prices for stainless steel cold-rolled sheet and strip and stainless hot-rolled products, effective with May 5 shipments.</p>
<p>The company said transaction prices will increase about 5.0 percent via a 3.0 percent reduction in service center and end-user discounts.</p>
<p>The company said the current surcharge mechanism, applicable to nickel, chrome and molybdenum, will remain in place.</p>
</text>
